" & Analytical Processing (HSAP) Database. It can execute high-frequency "
"queries and upsert, interactive analysis, multi-dimensional analysis in "
"extremely low latency. To achieve high concurrency and high throughput, "
"DingoDB uses an elastic distributed deployment mode."
